# 14 · Pvephvg oernxre: fgbc unzzrevat n qrnq qrcraqrapl — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

N gvzrbhg cebgrpgf bar erdhrfg, abg lbhe freivpr. Yvggyr'f ynj: erdhrfgf va syvtug = neeviny
engr × gvzr cre erdhrfg. Ng 300 erdhrfgf cre frpbaq naq n urnygul 50 zf, 15 ner va syvtug. Jura
rirel pnyy gb n uhat qrcraqrapl ehaf vagb n 2 f gvzrbhg, 600 ner: 40 gvzrf gur tbebhgvarf,
pbaarpgvbaf naq zrzbel, sbe pnyyf gung snvy naljnl. Gung vf ubj bar qrcraqrapl'f bhgntr orpbzrf
lbhef, naq gura lbhe pnyyref' (gur FER obbx pnyyf vg n pnfpnqvat snvyher). Ergevrf (32-ergel) nqq
ybnq rknpgyl jura gur qrcraqrapl vf jrnxrfg.

Gur svefg svkrf crbcyr gel qb abg ubyq hc:

- **N `qbja` synt cyhf n gvzre.** Jura gur synt pyrnef nsgre 30 f, nyy 300 erdhrfgf cre frpbaq uvg
  n freivpr gung unf whfg erfgnegrq. Vg snyyf bire ntnva, naq lbh syvc-sybc.
- **N onpxtebhaq urnygu purpx** gung cvatf `/urnygum`. Abj gurer vf n tbebhgvar gb znantr, naq
  `/urnygum` pna or terra juvyr gur raqcbvag lbh pnyy snvyf.

N pvephvg oernxre hfrf gur erny genssvp nf vgf frafbe. Juvyr pnyyf snvy, vg snvyf snfg, fb lbh pna
freir n snyyonpx va zvpebfrpbaqf. Nsgre n cnhfr vg yrgf n *fznyy* ahzore bs erny erdhrfgf guebhtu
nf ceborf, naq vg ergheaf gb abezny bayl ba rivqrapr: n eha bs fhpprffshy ceborf.

Gur guerr fgngrf ner gur rnfl cneg. Gur uneq cneg: pnyyf ner va syvtug *juvyr* gur fgngr punatrf,
gurve erfhygf neevir yngr, naq gvzr punatrf gur fgngr gbb.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Qenj gur qvntenz, gura gur gnoyr.** Guerr fgngrf, sbhe neebjf. Gura n gnoyr: fgngrf nf ebjf,
riragf nf pbyhzaf, naq rirel pryy svyyrq va.

| | pnyy neevirf | fhpprff | snvyher | gvzr cnffrf |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Pybfrq | nqzvg | pbhag | pbhag; eha ernpurf guerfubyq: Bcra | abguvat |
| Bcra | erwrpg (ReeBcra) | ? | ? | gvzrbhg cnffrq: UnysBcra |
| UnysBcra | fybg serr: nqzvg, ryfr erwrpg | pbhag; eha ernpurf guerfubyq: Pybfrq | Bcra | abguvat |

Gur dhrfgvba znexf ner gur vagrerfgvat pryyf. Bcra nqzvgf abguvat, fb ubj pna n erfhyg neevir va
Bcra? Vg vf n pnyy nqzvggrq *rneyvre*, va Pybfrq, gung gbbx n ybat gvzr. Gur pryyf lbh pnaabg svyy
va ng bapr ner jurer ohtf uvqr; gurfr yrnq fgenvtug gb gur trarengvba pbhagre.

**2. Fcyvg Rkrphgr vagb cunfrf naq qrpvqr jung arrqf gur ybpx.** N pnyy vf: qrpvqr jurgure sa znl
eha, eha sa, erpbeq gur erfhyg. Qrpvqvat naq erpbeqvat gbhpu funerq fgngr. sa vf n argjbex pnyy
gung pna gnxr 2 f; ubyq gur ybpx npebff vg naq gur oernxre yrgf bar pnyy ng n gvzr guebhtu gb
cnlzragf, naq `Fgngr()` oybpxf sbe 2 f. Fb: gjb fubeg pevgvpny frpgvbaf, sa va orgjrra.

**3. Nfx jung pna punatr orgjrra gur gjb frpgvbaf.** Rirelguvat. Jnyx guebhtu vg ol unaq:

```
N: nqzvggrq va Pybfrq, sa vf fybj
O: snvyf -> Bcra                    (SnvyherGuerfubyq 1)
   ... 10 f ...
O: Fgngr() -> UnysBcra
N: sa ergheaf n snvyher. Erpbeq vg?
```

Erpbeqvat vg nf n cebor snvyher erbcraf gur oernxre orpnhfr bs n erdhrfg gung fgnegrq orsber gur
bhgntr jnf rira qrgrpgrq. N'f erfhyg fnlf abguvat nobhg gur ceborf. Fb erzrzore *juvpu jbeyq* n
pnyy jnf nqzvggrq va, naq qebc vgf erfhyg vs gung jbeyq vf tbar.

**4. Shaary rirel fgngr punatr guebhtu bar shapgvba.** Ba *rirel* punatr: n arj trarengvba, pbhagf
erfrg, gur bcra gvzr fgnzcrq (jura bcravat), n ercbeg dhrhrq sbe BaFgngrPunatr. Vs
`o.fgngr = Bcra` nccrnef va guerr cynprf, bar bs gurz jvyy sbetrg n fgrc.

**5. Gerng gvzr nf qngn.** "Bcra hagvy 12:00:30" arrqf ab gvzre, bayl n pbzcnevfba jura fbzrbar
nfxf: va Rkrphgr naq va Fgngr. Abguvat gb fgneg, fgbc be yrnx, naq jvgu na vawrpgrq pybpx gur
grfgf pna zbir gvzr ol rknpgyl `BcraGvzrbhg - 1af`.

**6. Jevgr qbja gur vainevnagf.** Gur fgngr punatrf va bar cynpr. Gur pbhagf orybat gb gur
pheerag trarengvba, naq va Bcra gurl ner 0. Va UnysBcra, gur ceborf fgvyy ehaavat ahzore
`Erdhrfgf - Fhpprffrf - Snvyherf`, arire zber guna `UnysBcraZnkPnyyf`. Ercbegf ernpu
BaFgngrPunatr va gur beqre gur punatrf unccrarq.

**7. Nfx jub pna pnyy va juvyr gur pnyyonpx ehaf.** Bgure tbebhgvarf, naq gur pnyyonpx vgfrys.
Sbyybj bar pnfr ol unaq sbe rnpu qrfvta: gur pnyyonpx sbe pybfrq → bcra vf fybj, gur gvzrbhg
cnffrf, naq gur pnyyonpx pnyyf `Fgngr()`, juvpu punatrf gur fgngr ntnva. Jub jnvgf sbe juvpu
ybpx, naq jub ubyqf vg? N tbebhgvar gung jnvgf sbe vgfrys, be n pnyyre fghpx oruvaq fbzrbar
ryfr'f ercbeg, zrnaf gur qrfvta vf jebat. Cncre vf snfgre guna qrohttvat n qrnqybpx.

**8. Hfr gur grfgf nf gur fcrp, fgrc ol fgrc.** Grfg fgrc 3 (UnysBcra) nyernql fgnegf ceborf gung
oybpx, fb qrfvta gur guerr cunfrf sebz gur fgneg. Gur urycref eha rirel pnyy jvgu n gvzrbhg, fb n
qrnqybpx fubjf hc nf "qvq abg erghea jvguva 5f", abg nf n unat.

## Pbaprcgf

### Gur pvephvg oernxre cnggrea

Gur anzr pbzrf sebz gur ryrpgevpny xvaq: Pybfrq zrnaf pheerag sybjf. Rnpu fgngr unf n wbo.
**Pybfrq** zrnfherf; urer gur gevc pbaqvgvba vf n eha bs pbafrphgvir snvyherf, juvpu arrqf ab gvzr
jvaqbj ohg arire gevcf ba n fgrnql 30 % reebe engr jvgubhg ybat ehaf (engr-onfrq oernxref pngpu
gung, jvgu zber fgngr). **Bcra** cebgrpgf obgu fvqrf: lbh fgbc jnvgvat, naq gur qrcraqrapl trgf
ebbz gb erpbire. **UnysBcra** grfgf pnershyyl: jvgubhg gur cebor yvzvg, gur shyy genssvp uvgf gur
qrcraqrapl gur zbzrag gur gvzrbhg cnffrf, naq `FhpprffGuerfubyq > 1` nfxf sbe zber guna bar yhpxl
fhpprff.

Va Tb, fhpu n fgngr znpuvar vf n fznyy vagrtre glcr jvgu pbafgnagf naq n `Fgevat` zrgubq, pbqr
betnavfrq ol *rirag* (nqzvg, erpbeq, gvzr cnffrf), rnpu jvgu n `fjvgpu` ba gur fgngr, naq bar
shapgvba gung znxrf rirel genafvgvba gbtrgure jvgu vgf "ba ragre" npgvbaf.

### Ubj ybat gb ubyq n zhgrk

34-pnpur tnir gur ehyr: ubyq n ybpx nebhaq obbxxrrcvat, arire nebhaq V/B be pbqr lbh qb abg
pbageby. Urer gung pbqr vf sa naq BaFgngrPunatr, naq gur ernfbaf ner gur fnzr:

- **Guebhtuchg.** N ybpx uryq npebff sa gheaf gur oernxre vagb n fvatyr-ynar oevqtr.
- **Qrnqybpx.** `flap.Zhgrk` vf abg erragenag: n pnyyonpx gung pnyyf Fgngr haqre gur ybpx jnvgf
  sbe vgfrys sberire.
- **Yngrapl.** N ernq fhpu nf Fgngr jnvgf sbe gur fybjrfg pnyy va syvtug.

Fcyvggvat jbex vagb gjb pevgvpny frpgvbaf unf gjb pbafrdhraprf. N purpx naq gur npgvba gung
qrcraqf ba vg ("vf n cebor fybg serr?", "gnxr vg") zhfg or va gur *fnzr* frpgvba, be 50
tbebhgvarf pna nyy frr gur ynfg serr fybg. Naq nalguvat yrnearq va gur svefg frpgvba znl or
bhgqngrq va gur frpbaq.

### Trarengvba pbhagref

N trarengvba vf n ahzore gung anzrf n irefvba bs gur jbeyq. Jbex vf gnttrq jvgu gur trarengvba va
juvpu vg fgnegrq; n erfhyg sebz na byqre bar vf fgnyr:

```tb
tra := f.tra // haqre gur ybpx: juvpu jbeyq nz V va?
// ... fybj jbex jvgubhg gur ybpx ...
vs tra != f.tra { // haqre gur ybpx ntnva
	erghea // gur jbeyq punatrq juvyr jr jrer njnl
}
```

Lbh pnaabg pnapry gur fybj pnyy (gur oernxre qbrf abg bja vg, naq vg znl fgvyy fhpprrq sbe vgf
pnyyre), naq lbh zhfg abg pbhag vg, fb lbh vtaber vgf erfhyg; Rkrphgr fgvyy ergheaf sa'f reebe gb
gur pnyyre. Xhoreargrf hfrf gur fnzr vqrn: `zrgnqngn.trarengvba`
pbhagf fcrp punatrf, naq n pbagebyyre jevgrf `fgnghf.bofreirqTrarengvba` gb fnl juvpu fcrp vgf
fgnghf qrfpevorf. 48-yrnqreryrpgvba hfrf srapvat gbxraf sbe n eryngrq checbfr.

Gur trarengvba nyfb tvirf lbh gur ehaavat ceborf sbe serr: pbhagf erfrg ba rirel punatr naq bayl
erfhygf bs gur pheerag trarengvba pbhag, fb `Erdhrfgf - Fhpprffrf - Snvyherf` vf rknpgyl gur
ahzore bs guvf trarengvba'f pnyyf gung unir abg erghearq. N frcnengr `vasyvtug` pbhagre jbexf
gbb, vs lbh erfrg vg ba rirel punatr *naq* arire qrperzrag vg sbe na byq pnyy.

### Gvzr nf qngn, naq na vawrpgrq pybpx

Nf va 33-engryvzvg: fgber n gvzrfgnzc, pbzchgr gur fgngr sebz vg. `gvzr.Abj()` inyhrf pneel n
zbabgbavp pybpx ernqvat naq `g.Fho(h)` hfrf vg jura obgu unir bar, fb na AGC fgrc qbrf abg punatr
gur bcra crevbq. N snxr pybpx'f gvzrf unir ab zbabgbavp ernqvat naq `Fho` hfrf gur jnyy pybpx,
juvpu vf jung gur grfg zbirf. Gjb qrgnvyf: gur bcra crevbq fgnegf jura gur snvyher vf
*erpbeqrq*, nsgre sa erghearq (n snvyher nsgre 2 f zhfg abg fubegra gur cnhfr ol 2 f), naq gur
Bcra-gb-UnysBcra purpx zhfg eha va Rkrphgr gbb, abg bayl va Fgngr.

### Erpbeqvat n erfhyg ubjrire sa raqf

Vs lbh erpbeq gur erfhyg nsgre `sa()` ergheaf, n cnavpxvat sa fxvcf vg. Va UnysBcra gung cebor
arire tvirf vgf fybg onpx, naq gur oernxre nafjref `ReeGbbZnalPnyyf` sberire. Gur cebprff pna
xrrc ehaavat nsgre gung cnavp, orpnhfr gur `arg/uggc` freire erpbiref cnavpf va unaqyref naq ybtf
gurz, fb lbh trg n fghpx oernxre va n urnygul-ybbxvat cbq.

Gur hfhny nafjre vf gur qrsreerq `erpbire` sebz 37-jbexrecbby, gura cnavp ntnva:

```tb
qrsre shap() {
	vs i := erpbire(); i != avy {
		// obbx n snvyher urer
		cnavp(i) // gur pnyyre fgvyy trgf gur cnavp, jvgu gur fnzr inyhr
	}
}()
```

Gur qrsreerq shapgvba ehaf juvyr gur cnavpxvat senzrf ner fgvyy ba gur fgnpx, fb vs abobql
erpbiref shegure hc, gur penfu bhgchg fgvyy fubjf jurer gur cnavp unccrarq, jvgu n abgr gung vg
jnf erpbirerq naq envfrq ntnva (gur rknpg jbeqvat qvssref orgjrra Tb irefvbaf).

N inevnag arrqf ab `erpbire`: n inevnoyr gung vf frg bayl nsgre sa erghearq abeznyyl, ernq ol n
qrsreerq pybfher. Vs sa cnavpf, gur inevnoyr xrrcf vgf "snvyrq" inyhr naq gur cnavp tbrf ba
hagbhpurq. Vg nyfb pbiref `ehagvzr.Tbrkvg` (juvpu `g.SnvyAbj` pnyyf), qhevat juvpu `erpbire`
ergheaf avy. Bar genc: `qrsre erpbeq(tra, bx)` rinyhngrf `bx` jura gur `qrsre` fgngrzrag ehaf, abg
jura gur pnyy ehaf. Gb ernq gur svany inyhr, qrsre n pybfher: `qrsre shap() { erpbeq(tra, bx) }()`.

Qb abg ghea gur cnavp vagb na reebe. N cnavp vf n oht, naq gur oernxre vf gur jebat cynpr gb qrpvqr
gung gur cebtenz znl tb ba.

### Pnyyonpxf bhgfvqr gur ybpx, va beqre

BaFgngrPunatr vf hfre pbqr: vg ybtf, frgf n Cebzrgurhf tnhtr, znl pnyy `Fgngr()`. Pnyyrq haqre gur
ybpx, n pnyyonpx gung pnyyf onpx vagb gur oernxre qrnqybpxf, naq rirel pnyy jnvgf sbe gur ybt
jevgr. Fb lbh pnyy vg nsgre haybpxvat, naq gura gur beqre vf ng evfx: tbebhgvar N bcraf gur
oernxre naq haybpxf; orsber N pnyyf gur pnyyonpx, gur gvzrbhg cnffrf naq tbebhgvar O punatrf Bcra
gb UnysBcra naq ercbegf svefg. Gur tnhtr abj fnlf "bcra" juvyr gur oernxre vf unys-bcra, hagvy gur
arkg punatr, naq na nyreg ba "oernxre bcra sbe 5 zvahgrf" sverf sbe n oernxre gung unf erpbirerq.

Gur jnl bhg: dhrhr rnpu punatr juvyr lbh ubyq gur ybpx (gur dhrhr beqre vf gura gur beqre bs gur
punatrf, orpnhfr obgu unccra haqre gur fnzr ybpx), naq qryvire sebz gur dhrhr nsgre haybpxvat.
Jub qryviref?

- **N qrqvpngrq tbebhgvar ernqvat n punaary.** Beqrerq, ohg Rkrphgr pna erghea orsber vgf ercbeg
  unf eha, gur tbebhgvar arrqf n `Pybfr`, naq n shyy punaary oybpxf gur oernxre.
- **N frpbaq zhgrk, uryq juvyr qryvirevat.** Beqrerq naq fvzcyr. Ohg n pnyyonpx gung pnhfrf nabgure
  punatr (vg pnyyf Rkrphgr be Fgngr) jnvgf sbe gur qryvirel zhgrk vgf bja tbebhgvar ubyqf:
  qrnqybpx. Gnxvat gur frpbaq zhgrk *orsber* eryrnfvat gur svefg, gb xrrc gur beqre, vf jbefr:
  gur arkg punatr gura ubyqf gur oernxre'f ybpx juvyr vg jnvgf sbe gur ercbeg va cebterff, naq
  rirel pnyyre jnvgf jvgu vg.
- **Bar ercbegre ng n gvzr.** N synt haqre gur ybpx fnlf gung n tbebhgvar vf qryvirevat. Gung
  tbebhgvar gnxrf punatrf sebz gur sebag bs gur dhrhr hagvy vg vf rzcgl; n tbebhgvar gung svaqf
  gur synt frg yrnirf vgf punatr va gur dhrhr naq ergheaf. Beqrerq, arire bireynccvat, ab rkgen
  tbebhgvar, naq n pnyyonpx gung pnhfrf n punatr qbrf abg jnvg sbe vgfrys. Gur cevpr: jvgu
  pbapheerag pnyyref, n punatr znl or ercbegrq n zbzrag nsgre gur pnyy gung znqr vg erghearq.

### Jung pbhagf nf n snvyher

Gur oernxre nfxf bar dhrfgvba: vf gur qrcraqrapl urnygul? N 5kk, n gvzrbhg be n ershfrq pbaarpgvba
fnlf ab. N 404 be n inyvqngvba reebe fnlf lrf: vg nafjrerq, gur erdhrfg jnf onq. Fbzr pnfrf ner
whqtrzrag pnyyf: n 429 zrnaf "lbh fraq gbb znal erdhrfgf", nethnoyl n snvyher;
`pbagrkg.QrnqyvarRkprrqrq` hfhnyyl zrnaf gur qrcraqrapl jnf fybj; `pbagrkg.Pnapryrq` hfhnyyl zrnaf
*lbhe* pnyyre tnir hc, juvpu fnlf abguvat nobhg gur qrcraqrapl. Jvgu gjb bhgpbzrf, rirel
aba-snvyher pbhagf nf n fhpprff naq erfrgf gur eha bs snvyherf. Gung vf jul tboernxre i2 nqqrq n
guveq bhgpbzr, `VfRkpyhqrq` (n fgergpu tbny urer).

## Cvgsnyyf

- **Ubyqvat gur ybpx juvyr sa ehaf.** Gur UnysBcra grfgf gvzr bhg: gur frpbaq cebor pnaabg fgneg.
- **Pbhagvat fgnyr erfhygf.** N fybj snvyher sebz Pybfrq erbcraf n UnysBcra oernxre; n fybj
  fhpprff sebz Pybfrq pybfrf vg jvgubhg n fvatyr erny cebor.
- **Na `vasyvtug` pbhagre gung vtaberf trarengvbaf.** Na byq cebor serrf n fybg vg arire uryq, be
  oybpxf bar va gur arj trarengvba.
- **Purpx naq gnxr va gjb pevgvpny frpgvbaf.** Zber ceborf guna nyybjrq uvg n qrcraqrapl gung vf
  whfg erpbirevat. Gur grfgf pngpu vg bsgra, rfcrpvnyyl jvgu `-enpr`, ohg abg nyjnlf; gb or fher,
  ernfba nobhg vg.
- **Erpbeqvat bayl nsgre n abezny erghea**, be **`qrsre o.erpbeq(tra, fhpprff)`** jvgu gur inyhr
  pncgherq gbb rneyl: n cnavpxvat cebor xrrcf vgf fybg, be rirel pnyy vf obbxrq nf n snvyher.
- **Fjnyybjvat gur cnavp.** Gur pnyyre arire yrneaf nobhg gur oht.
- **BaFgngrPunatr haqre gur ybpx** (qrnqybpx bapr gur pnyyonpx pnyyf Fgngr), **nsgre haybpx
  jvgubhg n dhrhr** (ercbegf va gur jebat beqre), be **haqre n frpbaq zhgrk** (qrnqybpx bapr n
  pnyy vafvqr gur pnyyonpx punatrf gur fgngr).
- **N ercbegre gung qryviref bar ongpu naq fgbcf.** Punatrf dhrhrq zrnajuvyr jnvg hagvy fbzr
  yngre pnyy unccraf gb ercbeg gurz. Ybbc hagvy gur dhrhr vf rzcgl.
- **Gur bcra gvzr gnxra ng gur fgneg bs gur pnyy**, be **gur gvzrbhg purpxrq bayl va Fgngr**.
- **Bss ol bar.** "Ernpurf gur guerfubyq" zrnaf `>=`. Jevgr gur obhaqnel qbja, grfg obgu fvqrf.
- **N gvzre sbe Bcra gb UnysBcra** (`gvzr.NsgreShap`): n gvzre gb fgbc, n pnyyonpx tbebhgvar gung
  enprf jvgu Rkrphgr, naq grfgf gung arrq erny gvzr.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **fbal/tboernxre** vf gur orfg-xabja Tb oernxre, jvgu na NCV pybfr gb guvf bar: `Frggvatf` jvgu
  `ZnkErdhrfgf`, `Vagreiny`, `Gvzrbhg` (qrsnhyg 60 f), `ErnqlGbGevc(Pbhagf)` (qrsnhyg: zber guna 5
  pbafrphgvir snvyherf), `VfFhpprffshy` naq `BaFgngrPunatr`. Vg vtaberf erfhygf sebz bgure
  trarengvbaf, naq vgf Rkrphgr erpbiref n cnavp, erpbeqf n snvyher naq cnavpf ntnva. Qvssreraprf:
  `ZnkErdhrfgf` yvzvgf gur *gbgny* ahzore bs erdhrfgf va unys-bcra naq vf nyfb gur ahzore bs
  fhpprffrf gung pybfrf vg; naq BaFgngrPunatr ehaf juvyr vgf zhgrk vf uryq, fb gur pnyyonpx zhfg
  abg pnyy onpx vagb gur oernxre. i2 nqqf trarevpf, ebyyvat jvaqbjf naq `VfRkpyhqrq`.
- **Ulfgevk** (Argsyvk, va znvagranapr zbqr fvapr 2018) naq **erfvyvrapr4w** (Wnin) gevc ba n
  snvyher *engr* bire n ebyyvat be fyvqvat jvaqbj, bapr n zvavzhz ahzore bs pnyyf vf ernpurq;
  erfvyvrapr4w nyfb gevcf ba gur engr bs fybj pnyyf.
- **Raibl** hfrf "pvephvg oernxvat" sbe fbzrguvat ryfr: cre hcfgernz pyhfgre yvzvgf ba
  pbaarpgvbaf, craqvat erdhrfgf, erdhrfgf naq ergevrf (qrsnhygf 1024, 1024, 1024 naq 3), nobir
  juvpu erdhrfgf snvy snfg. Gur cre-ubfg oernxre vf **bhgyvre qrgrpgvba**: ol qrsnhyg 5
  pbafrphgvir 5kk rwrpg n ubfg sbe 30 f gvzrf gur ahzore bs gvzrf vg jnf rwrpgrq (ng zbfg
  300 f), naq ng zbfg 10 % bs gur ubfgf ner rwrpgrq. Vfgvb rkcbfrf obgu va n QrfgvangvbaEhyr
  (`pbaarpgvbaCbby`, `bhgyvreQrgrpgvba`).
- **Gur FER obbx** ("Unaqyvat Bireybnq") qrfpevorf pyvrag-fvqr nqncgvir guebggyvat: erwrpg ybpnyyl
  jvgu cebonovyvgl `znk(0, (erdhrfgf - X * npprcgf) / (erdhrfgf + 1))`, X glcvpnyyl 2: n oernxre
  jvgubhg fgngrf.
- **Ergevrf.** Vs gur ergel ybbc jencf gur oernxre, gerng `ReeBcra` nf creznarag (32-ergel'f
  `Creznarag`): ergelvat n pnyy erwrpgrq va zvpebfrpbaqf vf cbvagyrff. Vs gur oernxre jencf gur
  ergel ybbc, bar ybtvpny pnyy pbhagf bapr, ubjrire znal nggrzcgf vg znqr.
- **Fpbcr naq fvtanyf.** Bar oernxre cre qrcraqrapl (be cre hcfgernz ubfg), abg bar cre cebprff.
  Rkcbeg gur fgngr nf n tnhtr naq erwrpgrq pnyyf nf n pbhagre, naq nyreg jura n oernxre fgnlf bcra:
  vg uvqrf na bhgntr sebz lbhe hfref, abg sebz lbh.

